    {
      "text": "Jacob and Joseph … priests and teachers over the land of my people, 2 Ne. 5:26 (Jacob 1:18; Jarom 1:11; Mosiah 6:3; 23:17; Alma 15:13; 45:22; Moro. 3:1, 4). Alma … ordained priests, Mosiah 18:18. priests whom he had ordained should labor, Mosiah 18:24. priests were not to depend upon the people for their support, Mosiah 18:26. impart of their substance … to those priests that stood in need, Mosiah 18:28. he consecrated all their priests, Mosiah 23:17. every church having their priests … and every priest preaching the word, Mosiah 25:21. remember that the Lord God ordained priests, after his holy order, Alma 13:1.",
